"proxy.note" = "What Search fetches goes through it: pages, favicons, search suggestions, copied pictures, extensions and the Web Store, the AI add-on and Search's own updates. A video call is the exception: WebRTC sends its own traffic over UDP, which a proxy tunnel doesn't carry, so a call can still show a site your address. This Mac and .local names stay direct, so a local server still opens; a router or NAS reached by its address goes through the proxy. A proxy that can't be reached fails rather than going direct.";
